{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26705","headline":"赠卢大夫将军 · 姚合","name":"赠卢大夫将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军身在城，讵得虏尘清。\n酿酒邀闲客，吟诗直禁营。\n苍鹰春不下，战马夜空鸣。\n碣石应无业，皇州独有名。\n上山嫌䯗重，拔劒叹衣生。\n公议今如此，登坛到即行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}